entries[74274] = { ["name"] = "Plans: Phantom Blade", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUse: Teaches you how to forge a Phantom Blade.\nRequires Classic Blacksmithing (270)\n\nPhantom Blade\nBinds when equipped\nOne-Hand Sword\n3 - 6 Damage Speed 2.60\n(1.7 damage per second)\nDurability 90 / 90\nChance on hit: Decrease the armor of the target by 22 for 20 sec. While affected, the target cannot stealth or turn invisible.\nSell Price:\nRequires Mithril Bar (28), Breath of Wind (6), Truesilver Bar (8), Lesser Invisibility Potion (2), Aquamarine (6), Solid Grinding Stone (4), Thick Leather (2)\nOptional Reagents: Optional Reagent Slot (#49)" }
